Conflicts: fonts-ubuntu, ubuntu-mono, humanity-icon-theme
Description: palOS: stands in for the base system's own font and icon themes
 palOS draws with its own fonts and icons; this package takes the place of the base system's, which
 other base packages still name, so they can be removed without breaking updates.
